      "end_char": 1453,
      "text": "the unrefined oil that Mexico 1/ Includes freezing of toll rates and the reduction in import tariffs on basic foodstuffs.\nexports and the refined oil that it imports. As an exporter of unrefined oil, Mexico has benefitted\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "S00008",
